  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/0d0389b3424039949aa63630442341de7c2308244856ea7ac5b98137aa2d8c81.png] \n\nGiven: 2 B 18 D 20 A 4 C 15 = ?\n\nDecoding the letters:\n\n \n \n\n Letters\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n coded as\n ÷ \n × \n +\n -\n \n \n\n2 B 18 D 20 A 4 C 15 = ? ⇒ 2 × 18 - 20 ÷ 4 + 15 = ?\n\n⇒__ **2 × **__**__18__ **- __**20 **____**÷ **____**4 **__+ 15 = ?\n\n⇒ __**36**__ - 5__** + 15**__\n\n⇒ 51 - 5 = 46\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\".**",
